Template: inputloop-gitcha-omni-gateway/enable
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Enable and start the omni-gateway service now?
 It serves the members in /etc/inputloop/omni/members.json on 127.0.0.1:8769
 (put nginx with TLS in front: nginx-omni.conf.example).  Say no until that
 file names your servers; then: systemctl enable --now omni-gateway
 Check them first with: omni-gateway --check
